<th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.75rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border); font-weight: 700;">APY</th>
<th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.75rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border); font-weight: 700;">Min Balance</th>
